Description: Derivations 4k intro by zipola/2010/Linux
 4k intro by zipola (Tuomo Sipola), released in November 2010 at
 Instanssi I/2010, where it ranked 7th in the combined demo compo.
 .
 Colored polygons, flocks of spinning triangles and a line-drawn font
 for the greetings, with sine-wave sound generated at start-up, written
 in C with SDL and OpenGL. Press any key to quit.
